sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Admin approves a pending submission
  participant U as Admin
  participant C as Admin Console
  participant A as Express API
  participant S as Supabase
  participant L as Activity Log
  U->>C: Click Approve
  C->>A: POST /api/admin/submissions/:id/approve
  A->>S: submissions.findById(id)
  S-->>A: pending submission
  A->>A: validateTemplate + resolvePublisher
  A->>S: assertSlugAvailable(slug)
  S-->>A: slug free
  A->>S: templates.insert(payload)
  S-->>A: created template
  A->>S: syncTags(templateId, tags)
  A->>S: submissions.markApproved(id, templateId)
  A->>L: record submission.approved
  A-->>C: 200 { submission, template }
  C-->>U: Submission moves to approved
  Note over S: Only submissions in pending state can be approved.
